ITEM @eleitoral00017
    id_item: ELE00017_E001
    quote: Finally, our team developed a grounded typology in an iterative process and manu- ally cataloged the base URLs, and this process is described in detail below. Our team labeled a total of 710 base URLs following the described method. Using a simple Python script, the coding decisions for the base URLs were applied to individual links that users shared during the political events.
    memo: Os autores relatam construção iterativa de grounded typology, rotulação manual de 710 URLs-base e aplicação computacional das decisões por script Python. O excerto liga desenvolvimento, unidades codificadas e ferramenta, sem afirmar que o script esteja publicamente disponível.
    code: qp1_artefatos, qp5_construcao, qp6_tecnicas_ferramentas_dados
    pagina: 10, física do PDF
    localizador: ELE00017_sourcing_and_automation_of_political_news_and_information_over_social_me.pdf#page=10&selection=25,0,29,35
